hadiths[20]{hadithnumber,text}:
"274","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Muhairiz (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, woh Abu Mahdhurah ki kafalat mein yateem the yahan tak ke unhon ne unhen Shaam ke liye taiyar farmaya: Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Mahdhurah se kaha: Ai chacha, main Shaam ja raha hun; mujhe andesha hai ke mujh se tumhari azan ke bare mein poocha jae. To unhon ne mujhe khabar di ke Abu Mahdhurah ne un se kaha: Ji; main ek jama'at mein nikla; ham Hunain ke raste mein the; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Hunain se wapas aae; ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se raste mein mile. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke muazzin ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas namaz ki azan kahi; ham ne muazzin ki aawaz suni jabke ham kinare the; ham chillaye us ki naql karte aur us ka mazaq udate. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aawaz suni; Aap ne hamari taraf bheja yahan tak ke ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne khade hue. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se kaun hai jis ki aawaz main ne buland suni?' To qaum sab ne meri taraf ishara kiya; unhon ne sach kaha. To Aap ne sab ko chhor diya aur mujhe rok liya. Aap ne farmaya: 'Khade ho, namaz ki azan kaho.' To main khada hua; mujhe sab se zyada na-pasand Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur jo Aap mujhe hukm farmate the the. To main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne khada hua; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe khud azan sikhai. Aap ne farmaya: 'Kaho: Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar, Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar, Ashhadu alla ilaha illallah, Ashhadu alla ilaha illallah, Ashhadu anna Muhammadan Rasulullah, Ashhadu anna Muhammadan Rasulullah.' Phir mujh se farmaya: 'Wapas jao, apni aawaz buland karo.' Phir mujh se farmaya: 'Kaho: Ashhadu alla ilaha illallah, Ashhadu alla ilaha illallah, Ashhadu anna Muhammadan Rasulullah, Ashhadu anna Muhammadan Rasulullah, Hayya alash-shalah Hayya alash-shalah, Hayya alal-falah Hayya alal-falah, Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar, La ilaha illallah.' Phir mujhe bulaya jab main azan se farigh hua; mujhe thaili di jis mein chandi thi. Phir Apna hath Abu Mahdhurah ki peshani par rakha, us ke chehre par phera, us ke seene ke darmiyan, kaleje par, yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka hath Abu Mahdhurah ki naaf tak pahuncha. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Barakallahu feeka wa baraka alaika [Allah tum mein barkat de aur tum par barkat farmaye].' To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe Makkah mein azan ka hukm den. Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak main ne tumhen us ka hukm diya hai.' Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se jo nafrat thi sab chali gayi; woh sab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki muhabbat mein badal gayi. To main Attab bin Aseed, Makkah mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke amil ke paas aaya; main ne un ke sath namaz ki azan Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke hukm se kahi. Ibn Juraij kehte hain: Mujhe jinhen main ne Aale Abu Mahdhurah mein se paya unhon ne mujhe aisa hi khabar di jaisa Ibn Muhairiz ne khabar di."
"275","[AI-translation] Umar bin Ata bin Abi Al-Khuwar (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Nafi bin Jubair ne unhen As-Saib bin Yazid, Namir ki bahen ke bete ke paas bheja us cheez ke bare mein poochne jo unhon ne Mu'awiyah se namaz mein dekhi. Unhon ne kaha: Ji; main ne Mu'awiyah ke sath maqsurah mein Jumuah padhi; jab salam phera to main apni jagah khada hua aur namaz padhi. Jab woh dakhil hue to unhon ne meri taraf bheja. Unhon ne kaha: Jo tum ne kiya us par wapas na jao; jab tum Jumuah padho to use namaz se na milao yahan tak ke baat karo ya niklo. 'Kyunke Nabi Allah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)' ne is ka hukm diya: Namaz namaz se na milai jae yahan tak ke nikle ya baat kare."
"276","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab farz namaz shuru farmate to farmate: 'Wajjahtu wajhiya lillazi fataras-samawati wal-arza haneefan wa ma ana minal-mushrikeen, inna shalati wa nusuki wa mahyaya wa mamati lillahi rabbil-alameen la shareeka lahu, wa bizalika umirtu wa ana awwalul-muslimeen, Allahumma antal-malik la ilaha illa anta subhanaka wa bihamdika anta rabbi wa ana abduka zalamtu nafsi wa'taraftu bizanbi, faghfirli zunubi jami'an la yaghfiruz-zunuba illa anta, wahdini liahsanil-akhlaq la yahdi liahsaniha illa anta, wasrif anni sayyi'aha la yashrifu anni sayyi'aha illa anta, labbaika wa sa'daika walkhairu biyadaika, walmahdiyyu man hadaita, ana bika tabarakta wa ta'alaita, astaghfiruka wa atubu ilaika [Main ne apna chehra Us ki taraf kiya jis ne aasmanon aur zameen ko paida farmaya yakso hokar, main mushrikon mein se nahin. Beshak meri namaz, meri qurbani, meri zindagi, meri maut Allah ke liye hai jo tamam jahanon ka Rabb hai, Us ka koi shareek nahin; isi ka mujhe hukm diya gaya, main pehle Musalmanon mein se hun. Ai Allah, Tu Badshah hai Tere siwa koi mabood nahin, Tu pak hai Teri hamd ke sath, Tu mera Rabb hai main Tera banda hun, main ne apni jaan par zulm kiya apne gunah ka iqrar kiya, mere tamam gunah bakhsh de gunah Tere siwa koi nahin bakhshta, mujhe behtareen akhlaq ki hidayat de us ke behtareen ki hidayat Tere siwa koi nahin deta, mujh se us ke bure ko pher de us ke bure ko mujh se Tere siwa koi nahin pherta, main hazir hun Teri khushi mere liye, bhalai Tere hath mein hai, hidayat wala woh hai jise Tun ne hidayat di, main Tere sath barkat wala hua aur buland hua, Tujh se bakhshish mangta hun aur Teri taraf tauba karta hun].'"
"277","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib karramallahu wajhahu se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se aise hi ma'na ki riwayat hai; siwae is ke ke Aap jab namaz kholte to farmate: 'Wajjahtu wajhiya.'"
"278","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab ruku farmate to farmate: 'Allahumma laka raka'tu wa bika amantu wa laka aslamtu anta rabbi khasha'a laka sam'i wa bashari wa lahmi wa azmi wa mastaqallat bihi qadami lillahi rabbil-alameen [Ai Allah, Tere liye main ne ruku kiya, Tujh par iman laya, Tere liye farmabardar hua, Tu mera Rabb hai, Tere liye meri sama'at, meri basarat, mera gosht, meri haddi jhuki, aur jo mere qadam ne uthaya Allah ke liye jo tamam jahanon ka Rabb hai].'"
"279","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham apni bandiyan bechte: Ummahatul-aulad [jo apne aaqa ke bachche janen], jabke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ham mein zinda the; ham is mein koi harj nahin samajhte the."
"280","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Kunwari ke liye saat [din bari nayi dulhan ke paas] aur bewa ke liye teen [din]; yahi sunnat hai."
"281","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas [Raziyallahu anhu] se aisi hi riwayat hai."
"282","[AI-translation] Ata (Rahimahullah) se Ibn Abbas [Raziyallahu anhuma] se riwayat hai ke woh hukm farmate jab farz namaz padhe aur us ke ba'd nafl padhna chahe ke nafl na padhe yahan tak ke aage badhe ya baat kare. Kabhi woh use bayan farmate aur kehte: 'Jab tum mein se koi farz namaz padhe phir us ke ba'd namaz padhna chahe to namaz na padhe yahan tak ke aage badhe ya baat kare.'"
"283","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se apne walid se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Beshak Bilal raat mein azan kehte hain; khao aur piyo yahan tak ke Ibn Umm Maktoom azan kahen.'"
"284","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Beshak Bilal raat mein azan kehte hain; khao aur piyo yahan tak ke Ibn Umm Maktoom azan kahen.'"
"285","[AI-translation] Salim bin Abdullah bin Umar (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Beshak Bilal raat mein azan kehte hain; khao aur piyo yahan tak ke Ibn Umm Maktoom azan kahen.' Ravi kehte hain: Woh nabina aadmi the; azan nahin kehte yahan tak ke un se kaha jata: Tumhen subah hui, tumhen subah hui."
"286","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap se kaha: Main halaak hua. Aap ne farmaya: 'Tumhen kis ne halaak kiya?' Us ne kaha: Main Ramadan mein apni biwi se mila. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kya tum gardan pate ho jise tum aazad karo?' Us ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya tum lagatar do mahine roze rakh sakte ho?' Us ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya tum saath miskeenon ko khana khila sakte ho?' Us ne kaha: Main use nahin pata. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: 'Baith jao.' Jab woh aise baithe the ke achanak araq [tokra paimana] laya gaya jis mein khajoor thi. Sufyan kehte hain: Araq paimana hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: 'Jao, is se sadqa karo.' Us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, qasam Us ki jis ne Aap ko haq ke sath bheja, is ke dono pathrile kinaron [Madinah] ke darmiyan ham se zyada is ka mohtaj koi ghar nahin. Ravi kehte hain: To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hanse yahan tak ke Aap ki daden zahir huin, phir farmaya: 'Jao, use apne ghar walon ko khilao.'"
"287","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Ramadan mein roza toda; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use kaffare ka hukm diya gardan aazad karne, ya do mahine roze, ya saath miskeenon ko khana khilane se. Us ne kaha: Main nahin pata. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas khajoor ka araq laya gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh lo, is se sadqa karo.' Us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujh se zyada mohtaj main kisi ko nahin pata. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hanse yahan tak ke Aap ki daden zahir huin, phir farmaya: 'Use khao.'"
"288","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko hukm diya jis ne mah Ramadan mein roza toda ke gardan aazad kare, ya do mahine ke roze, ya saath miskeenon ko khana khilana."
"289","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi subah rozedar ho to behuda baat na kare aur na jahalat kare. Agar koi use bura kahe to kahe: Main rozedar hun, main rozedar hun.' Abu Zinad ne us mein izafa farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se kisi ko khane ki taraf bulaya jae jabke woh rozedar ho to kahe: Main rozedar hun.'"
"290","[AI-translation] Talhah bin Yahya ki phuphi (Rahimahallah) se Aishah, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zauja [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas tashreef lae; main ne kaha: Ham ne Aap ke liye hais [khajoor paneer ghee ka khana] chhupaya hai. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Rahi baat main ne roze ka irada kiya tha; lekin use qareeb karo; main us ki jagah ek din roza rakhunga.' Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Main ne Muzani ko kehte suna: Muhammad bin Idris Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne farmaya: Main ne Sufyan ko aam majlison mein suna woh us mein 'main us ki jagah ek din roza rakhunga' zikr nahin farmate; phir main ne wafaat se ek saal pehle use un par pesh kiya; unhon ne us mein 'main us ki jagah ek din roza rakhunga' jaiz farmaya."
"291","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Abbad bin Ja'far (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Abdullah se poocha jab woh Baitullah ka tawaf kar rahe the: Kya Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Jumuah ke din roze se mana farmaya? Unhon ne kaha: 'Ji, is ghar ke Rabb ki qasam.'"
"292","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Abbad (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Jabir bin Abdullah se poocha jab woh Baitullah ka tawaf kar rahe the. Unhon ne kaha: 'Kya tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Jumuah ke din roze se mana farmate suna?' To unhon ne kaha: Ji, is ghar ke Rabb ki qasam."
"293","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr Qari (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hurairah ko kehte suna: Main ne Jumuah ke din roze se mana nahin farmaya; lekin Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne, is ghar ke Rabb ki qasam, use farmaya."
